---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Accessibility Statement"
  description={`${site.name} commitment to digital accessibility under the ADA and WCAG 2.2 AA.`}
  eyebrow="Accessibility"
>
  <p>
    {site.name} is committed to ensuring that our website is accessible to people with disabilities,
    including users of screen readers and other assistive technologies. We aim to conform with the
    Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 at the AA level.
  </p>

  <h2>Our Commitment</h2>
  <p>
    We treat accessibility as a part of quality. Our site is built on semantic HTML, supports
    keyboard navigation, provides descriptive alternative text for images, maintains sufficient
    colour contrast, and avoids content that requires a specific input method.
  </p>

  <h2>Ongoing Efforts</h2>
  <p>
    Accessibility is an ongoing effort. We periodically review the Site against WCAG 2.2 AA success
    criteria and address issues as they are identified. We also design new content with
    accessibility in mind.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-Party Content</h2>
  <p>
    Some content, such as embedded vehicle history reports or links to third-party sites, is
    provided by others and may not fully meet our accessibility standards. We encourage you to
    contact those providers directly with any access barriers.
  </p>

  <h2>Feedback</h2>
  <p>
    If you encounter an accessibility barrier on this Site, or have suggestions on how we can
    improve, please contact us. We welcome your feedback and will do our best to respond and address
    your concerns.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>Email: <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a></li>
    <li>Phone: <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a></li>
    <li>Address: {site.address}</li>
  </ul>

  <p>
    When contacting us about an accessibility issue, please describe the page and the specific
    problem so we can investigate promptly.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
